resources.string:
Every time the person talks to the assistant, this leaves their phone:

• the text of what they said (the audio never leaves);
• the profile you wrote;
• the time, their upcoming visits and today's doses.

It goes to the company behind the AI model you choose, which writes the answer (Anthropic for Claude or Meta for Muse Spark), and to ElevenLabs (which provides the voice), through our server on Google Firebase. Conversations are kept for 7 days so you can see them here, and then they are deleted automatically.

The assistant is not a medical or emergency service.
